{"title":"About","markdown":{"yaml":{"title":"About"},"containsRefs":false,"markdown":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"about-hero-simple mb-4\">\n  <h1>About Me</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">\n    MBA student in Vancouver, combining a Chemical Engineering background with\n    digital transformation, data analytics, and AI for business.\n  </p>\n  <div class=\"mb-2\">\n    <span class=\"tag-pill\">Digital Transformation</span>\n    <span class=\"tag-pill\">Marketing &amp; Data</span>\n    <span class=\"tag-pill\">AI for Business</span>\n  </div>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-primary me-2\" href=\"resume.html\">View Resume</a>\n  <a class=\"btn btn-outline-secondary\" href=\"projects.html\">View Projects</a>\n</div>\n\n<hr class=\"my-4\" />\n\n<div class=\"card shadow-sm border-0 about-highlight-card mb-5\">\n  <div class=\"card-body\">\n    <h2 class=\"h4 mb-3\">Quick Snapshot</h2>\n    <ul class=\"list-unstyled mb-0\">\n      <li>🎓 MBA at <strong>University Canada West</strong> — Expected <strong>2026</strong></li>\n      <li>🧪 B.Eng in <strong>Chemical Engineering</strong>, Liaoning Petrochemical University (LNPU)</li>\n      <li>📦 Former <strong>Dispatcher</strong> at Hengshen Group</li>\n      <li>🌏 Languages: Mandarin, English, French (basic), Japanese (basic)</li>\n    </ul>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"mb-3\">Core Strengths</h2>\n<div class=\"row mb-5\">\n  <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"strength-box\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">Data-Driven Mindset</h3>\n      <p>\n        I enjoy turning complex data into simple stories that support marketing and\n        business decisions.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"strength-box\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">Cross-Disciplinary Background</h3>\n      <p>\n        Chemical Engineering training plus MBA studies gives me both technical and\n        business perspectives.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"col-md-4 mb-3\">\n    <div class=\"strength-box\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">AI &amp; Digital Tools</h3>\n      <p>\n        Hands-on experience using LLMs, dashboards, and cloud tools to support projects\n        and coursework.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"mb-3\">My Journey</h2>\n<div class=\"timeline mb-5\">\n\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-dot\"></div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">2018 – 2022 · Chemical Engineering Student</h3>\n      <p>\n        Studied at <strong>Liaoning Petrochemical University (LNPU)</strong>,\n        focusing on chemical processes, safety, and industrial operations.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-dot\"></div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">2022 – 2023 · Dispatcher at Hengshen Group</h3>\n      <p>\n        Coordinated production and logistics, managed schedules, and helped keep a\n        fast-paced factory running smoothly.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"timeline-item\">\n    <div class=\"timeline-dot\"></div>\n    <div class=\"timeline-content\">\n      <h3 class=\"h5\">2024 – Present · MBA in Canada</h3>\n      <p>\n        Moved to Vancouver and began my MBA at UCW, focusing on digital transformation,\n        analytics, and how AI can support business strategy.\n      </p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"mb-3\">Outside of Work &amp; Study</h2>\n<p>\n  In my free time, I like to explore Vancouver by bike, try photography, and keep\n  improving my language skills. These activities help me stay curious, observant, and\n  comfortable in new environments — qualities I also bring to group projects and\n  consulting work.\n</p>\n\n```\n\n","srcMarkdownNoYaml":"\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"about-hero-simple mb-4\">\n  <h1>About Me</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">\n    MBA student in Vancouver, combining a Chemical Engineering background with\n    digital transformation, data anal